  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_1_0": "Crystal Nova Cooldown Reduction: 1/2/3 seconds",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_1_1": "Crystal Nova Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 seconds",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_1_2": "Crystal Nova Cooldown Reduction: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 seconds",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_1_3": "Crystal Nova Cooldown Reduction: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> seconds",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_2_0": "Mana Regeneration: 10 \n\n Every 3rd hit of Crystal Nova on the same enemy applies Frostbite to them. \n\n Effect Duration: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_2_1": "Mana Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b> \n\n Every <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>rd hit of Crystal Nova on the same enemy applies Frostbite to them. \n\n Effect Duration: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_3_0": "Crystal Nova instantly triggers around the hero. \n\n Crystal Nova Radius Increase: 100/200",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_3_1": "Crystal Nova instantly triggers around the hero. \n\n Crystal Nova Radius Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/200",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_3_2": "Crystal Nova instantly triggers around the hero. \n\n Crystal Nova Radius Increase: 100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b>",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_4_0": "Crystal Nova Damage Increase: 6% of your Max Health",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_4_1": "Crystal Nova Damage Increase: <font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b> of your Max Health",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_5_0": "Crystal Nova reduces enemy Health Regeneration: 10%/20%/30% \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_5_1": "Crystal Nova reduces enemy Health Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%/30% \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_5_2": "Crystal Nova reduces enemy Health Regeneration: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/30% \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_5_3": "Crystal Nova reduces enemy Health Regeneration: 10%/20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_6_0": "Casting Crystal Nova increases Health Regeneration: 10/15/20 \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_6_1": "Casting Crystal Nova increases Health Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/15/20 \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_6_2": "Casting Crystal Nova increases Health Regeneration: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b>/20 \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_6_3": "Casting Crystal Nova increases Health Regeneration: 10/15/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b> \n\n Duration: 5 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_7_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Arcane Aura.</font></b> \n\n Freezing Field becomes a toggleable ability. It can no longer be interrupted. Does not cost Mana. Allows moving, attacking, and casting spells while active. \n\n Maintaining it consumes 12% of Maximum Health as Magical Damage each second.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_7_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Arcane Aura.</font></b> \n\n Freezing Field becomes a toggleable ability. It can no longer be interrupted. Does not cost Mana. Allows moving, attacking, and casting spells while active. \n\n Maintaining it consumes <b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b> of Maximum Health as Magical Damage each second.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_8_0": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: 3/6",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_8_1": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b>/6",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_8_2": "Strength, Agility, Intellect: 3/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b>",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_9_0": "Health: 100/200/300 \n\n When taking Damage from a Hero, automatically applies Frostbite to them. \n\n Cooldown: 45/30/15 sec.",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_9_1": "Health: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/200/300 \n\n When taking Damage from a Hero, automatically applies Frostbite to them. \n\n Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>45</font></b>/30/15 sec.",
