    "modifier_crystal_maiden_14_0": "New Active Ability: Crystal Clone \n\n The hero dashes in the chosen direction, disjointing incoming projectiles, and leaves behind a crystal clone. When the clone expires or is destroyed, Frostbite is applied to all enemies in a 450 radius. The owner's other abilities can also damage the clone. \n\n Range: 275 \n Cooldown: 15 sec. \n Mana Cost: 150 \n Clone Duration: 5 sec. \n Clone Health: 150",
    "modifier_crystal_maiden_14_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Crystal Clone</font></b> \n\n The hero dashes in the chosen direction, disjointing incoming projectiles, and leaves behind a crystal clone. When the clone expires or is destroyed, Frostbite is applied to all enemies in a <b><font color='#eabe10'>450</font></b> radius. The owner's other abilities can also damage the clone. \n\n Range: 275 \n Cooldown: 15 sec. \n Mana Cost: 150 \n Clone Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> sec. \n Clone Health: 150",
