    "modifier_crystal_maiden_20_1": "Casting any ability applies a buff that increases Mana Regeneration by <b><font color='#eabe10'>0.5%</font></b>, but increases Mana Cost and Mana Loss by <b><font color='#eabe10'>5%</font></b>. \n\n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/6/8 sec.",
